  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1427794/description_06a2fce7-8314-4547-89b3-9ed23fcd67b1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5000\" height=\"1229\"></h2>\n<h2>目前已实现的幸运方块包括<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/inca-lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">印加幸运方块</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/snake-lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蛇形幸运方块</a>。感谢<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/_sokoly_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sokoly</a>在开发过程中提供的支持。</h2>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">我们期待您加入新的幸运方块！如果您希望加入，请给我们留言。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\">核心库</h1>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1427794/description_ead20cc0-7650-481c-9f0c-68c79e199534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"203\"></a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1427794/description_f9e68fdf-3900-40df-b695-3c44f115cd1d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"180\"><br></a></h2>\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armorpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1427794/description_ab37505c-c2cf-441f-8ec8-c8a891817047.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"177\"></a></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
